  "style": "chibi cube pet, deliberately blocky (Kenney Cube Pets): one round, cube-like segment with four stubby feet, two knobbed antennae, white mandibles and a raised band across the back; coloured as a yellow caterpillar with a red back band (the cel scripts have no green); stylized size: 0.3 m to the top of the antennae, half the cube-pet monkey (0.6 m) and about knee-high on it, so in a garden two-shot the face and antennae still read while it stays clearly the small creature (a real caterpillar is about 5 cm, which would be a speck beside the monkey); rigid parts moved by node tracks, no skin; colour map flattened to flat colours",
