    "note": "The plan's own source (wave-1 row 57). Same zip, pin and route as the panda and monkey: ingested through Blender, with Textures/colormap.png as an extra member; the colour map flattens to 24 clusters: the 15 green clusters (a baked gradient on the body, legs and antennae) -> body, the 7 yellow clusters of the raised band across the back -> stripe, #e4e4ee -> eye (eye whites and mandibles), #4b4e5c -> dark (pupils, mouth). Recoloured from Kenney's green caterpillar with a yellow back band to a yellow caterpillar with a red band on the indigo script, which has no green. Ground: run hops and clamps so its landings never sink; walk is a bouncy trot that never sinks and is left as authored; eat lets the mandibles dip (sinkAllowed)."
